{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DEM_SECTION_7_6_2_FreezeFrame","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_SAEJ1939DiagnosticCommunicationManager","page":28,"text":"7.6.2 FreezeFrame\n[SWS_J1939Dcm_00017]\n⌈On\nstart\nof\nFreezeFrame\nsequence,\nthe\nJ1939 Diagnostic Communication Manager\nshall\ncall\nthe\nDem_-\nJ1939DcmSetFreezeFrameFilter\nwith\nthe\nparameter\nFreezeFrameKind\ndefined by the DMx message that triggered the sequence, as well as the assigned\nClientId of the requested node.⌋\n[SWS_J1939Dcm_00018] ⌈In case the Dem_J1939DcmSetFreezeFrameFilter\nreturns\nE_NOT_OK,\nthe\nJ1939 Diagnostic Communication Manager\nshall\ncall\nJ1939Rm_SendAck\nwith\nparameter\nackCode\nset\nto\nJ1939RM_ACK_-\nNEGATIVE\nto\nsend\na\nnegative acknowledgement\n(NACK)\n(considering\n[SWS_J1939Dcm_00113]).⌋","caption":"7.6.2 FreezeFrame","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DEM_SECTION_7_6_2_FreezeFrame","releases":["R23-11"],"page":26,"hash":"acb951d4344475ac","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DEM_SECTION_7_6_2_FreezeFrame","releases":["R24-11"],"page":27,"hash":"c5372293a425e51b","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DEM_SECTION_7_6_2_FreezeFrame","releases":["R25-11"],"page":28,"hash":"72f19a626ca4e971","caption":""}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_Dem_00977"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_J1939Dcm_00017] im Text von SWS_SAEJ1939DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_J1939Dcm_00017"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_J1939Dcm_00018] im Text von SWS_SAEJ1939DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_J1939Dcm_00018"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_J1939D